 she grows close to his 4-year-old daughter, Leila. She tucks her in, looks after her, and loves her like a mother... which she isn’t. Not yet. Rachel is 40. The desire for a family of her own is growing stronger, and the clock is ticking. Is it too late?"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Rachel a 40 ans, pas d'enfant. Elle aime sa vie : ses élèves du lycée, ses amis, ses ex, ses cours de guitare. En tombant amoureuse d’Ali, elle s’attache à Leila, sa fille de 4 ans. Elle la borde, la soigne, et l’aime comme la sienne.  Mais aimer les enfants des autres, c’est un risque à prendre…","tagline":"Aimer sans compter, même quand ce ne sont pas les nôtres."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bd4oCWEmlOJT867FH0ZBzLuQK1B.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9eIzy76swY4DnVWfmOsA689sjgo.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":803694,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bd4oCWEmlOJT867FH0ZBzLuQK1B.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bd4oCWEmlOJT867FH0ZBzLuQK1B.jpg","language":"it","width":1707,"height":2560},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bd4oCWEmlOJT867FH0ZBzLuQK1B.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bd4oCWEmlOJT867FH0ZBzLuQK1B.jpg","language":"it","width":1707,"height":2560}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5oDu0n0vc7D3t3RhxHDrT0Ezcoa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5oDu0n0vc7D3t3RhxHDrT0Ezcoa.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5oDu0n0vc7D3t3RhxHDrT0Ezcoa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5oDu0n0vc7D3t3RhxHDrT0Ezcoa.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":30